ints, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products! <\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>Shipping for orders under £40<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>Shipping for orders £40-£70<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}},"306ee80a-abbf-4074-92bc-03e3130ac128":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p>","page":""}},"76ea0ff4-bc0b-4d0b-b03b-714af7a6ab06":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Content - *SPOILER ALERT*","icon":"box","content":"<p><strong>Attention! <\/strong>Only read on if you want to know what you can look forward to in our new Shots Advent Calendar.<br\/><br\/>Moonshine flavours:<br\/>In this Shots Calendar, you can look forward to a variety of flavours - Tough Nut (25% vol.), Wild Berry (25% vol.), Very Cherry (20% vol.), Sticky Toffee (25% vol.), Macadamia (20% vol.), Roasted Apple (20% vol.), Blood Orange (20% vol.) & Lemon Drizzle (25% vol.);  all eight of these you will find three times apiece.<br\/><br\/>But don't tell anyone! 🤫<\/p>","page":""}},"db9001a3-1b36-464e-978a-6f3c5cd04e93":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","disabled":true,"settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","locale_option":"geolocation","locale_fallback":"","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}}},"block_order":["vendor","title","d4344a40-1c5b-400c-ae8f-fcdc24a5ef97","caption","price","variant_picker","92509ddc-3ec2-4529-b160-6e1da5dc9927","quantity_selecto